cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpenDLO, please cite it as below, and cite the method it
  implements: Gilbert et al. (2014), listed under references.
type: software
title: OpenDLO
abstract: >-
  A C++ library for discontinuity layout optimisation (DLO) of plates. It
  estimates the ultimate load of a plate under out-of-plane load as an
  automatic yield-line analysis, solving the layout as a linear program.
authors:
  - family-names: Cloete
    given-names: Renier
